What:		/proc/sentry_urma_comm/client_info
Date:		March 2025
Contact:	Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. <sxt1001@huawei.com>
Description:
		Configure and display URMA communication client information.

		Write Format:
			"server_eid1,server_eid2,...;server_eid3,server_eid4,... client_jetty_id"

		Read Format:
			"server_eid:eid1,eid2,..., client_jetty_id:jetty_id"

		Examples:
			echo "2001:0db8:85a3:0000:0000:8a2e:0370:7334,2001:0db8:85a3:0000:0000:8a2e:0370:7335; \
			2001:0db8:85a3:0000:0000:8a2e:0370:7336,2001:0db8:85a3:0000:0000:8a2e:0370:7337 100" \
			> /proc/sentry_urma_comm/client_info

			# Read current configuration
			cat /proc/sentry_urma_comm/client_info
			server_eid:2001:0db8:85a3:0000:0000:8a2e:0370:7334,2001:0db8:85a3:0000:0000:8a2e: \
			0370:7335;2001:0db8:85a3:0000:0000:8a2e:0370:7336,2001:0db8:85a3:0000:0000:8a2e:0370: \
			7337, client_jetty_id:100

		Notes:
		- URMA communication connections are automatically established after successful configuration
		- Supports multi-die architecture, each die can configure multiple server EIDs
		- The first EID must match the locally configured EID
		- Jetty ID range: [3, 1023]
		- EID addresses must use full IPv6 format: 128-bit numbers separated every 4 bits by colons

What:		/proc/sentry_urma_comm/heartbeat
Date:		March 2025
Contact:	Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. <sxt1001@huawei.com>
Description:
		Control heartbeat detection function of the URMA communication module.

		Write Values:
			"on"  - Enable heartbeat detection
			"off" - Disable heartbeat detection

		Read Values:
			"on" or "off" - Current heartbeat detection status

		Examples:
			# Enable heartbeat detection
			echo "on" > /proc/sentry_urma_comm/heartbeat

			# Disable heartbeat detection
			echo "off" > /proc/sentry_urma_comm/heartbeat

			# Check current status
			cat /proc/sentry_urma_comm/heartbeat

		Function Details:
		- Heartbeat interval: 60 seconds
		- Automatically detects connection status and attempts to rebuild broken connections
		- Automatically disables lock operations in system panic mode to prevent deadlocks